        "q": "How do you calculate ROI here?",
        "a": "When you enter both revenue and cost, ROI is calculated as (revenue minus cost) divided by cost, times 100. It shows the percentage return on every dollar of spend. The tool also shows net profit, revenue per visitor, and revenue per conversion."
