        "q": "Does this rename variables or fully compress my code?",
        "a": "No. This is a conservative whitespace-and-comment minifier. It removes comments, trims each line, and deletes blank lines, but it does not rename variables, shorten identifiers, or restructure code. For maximum compression, use a build-step tool like Terser or esbuild."
